  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "國際財務分析與投資決策",
    "sub_ename": "INTERNATIONAL FINANCIAL ANALYSIS AND INVESTMENT DECISION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將介紹理財的基本觀念，包含：財務管理的目標、金融環境、風險與報酬、資本資產訂價理論、及證券評價等。在這基礎之上，將詳細介紹如何做好財務管理的四大工作，即投資管理、融資管理、風險管理、及財務分析與規劃，以提昇企業價值。",
    "describe_eh": "In this course, students will learn to utilize the analytical and financial decision making skills taught in the basic finance course, extend these skills into new areas, and develop and apply new financial skills. The framework for approaching financial strategy will be an integrated approach considering all functional areas of business including ethical issues. The materials covered in the course should also provide guidance to students in selecting professional career paths in finance.　",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
